# 9. Why Thresholds Are Useful

A threshold reduces unnecessary alerts.

Example:

```text
1 failed login
    ↓
Usually normal

2 failed logins
    ↓
Probably normal

5+ repeated failures
    ↓
Potentially suspicious
```

The correct threshold depends on the environment.

