# 10. False Positive

Suppose a user repeatedly enters the wrong password.

The tool generates:

```text
ALERT
```

But there was no attacker.

This is a:

> **False positive**

---

# 11. False Negative

Suppose an attacker performs activity that does not meet the detection rule.

The tool produces:

```text
No Alert
```

even though suspicious activity occurred.

This is a:

> **False negative**

