# 21. Real-Time vs Batch Detection

### Batch detection

Processes logs periodically.

```text
Logs
 ↓
Every 5 minutes
 ↓
Analyze
```

### Real-time detection

Processes events as they arrive.

```text
Event
 ↓
Detection
 ↓
Alert
```

Real-time detection can reduce response time but is more complex.

